 "description": "<p>Not affiliated with Roblox. Research project, use at your own risk. Read the notice on our website before using.</p>\n      <p>We ported Roblox to Linux because they wouldn't.</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Enjoy millions of experiences on Roblox, chat with friends, and explore!</li>\n        <li>Seamlessly run Roblox on Linux, faster than on Windows.</li>\n        <li>No emulators. No virtual machines. No cruft. We disable ads and telemetry by default.</li>\n        <li>No strings attached - Sober is a community project. We made it closed source to reduce the potential for abuse (which would lead to Roblox blocking us again)</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p>Make Sober your own. See our documentation for a list of options.</p>\n      <ul>\n        <li>Turn on server location indicators, bring back the nostalgic oof sound, customize textures, try experimental settings, and more.</li>\n      </ul>\n    ",
 "developer_name": "VinegarHQ & Sober contributors",
